# The «Feedback about Vilna» window (eu). Review by a native speaker is welcome (Weblate).
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nX-Vilna-Review: not reviewed by a native speaker\n"

msgid "Feedback about Vilna"
msgstr "Vilnari buruzko iritziak"

msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Iritzia"

msgid "Crash reports"
msgstr "Hutsegite-txostenak"

msgid "Tell us what went wrong, what surprised you or what you would like. Only the Vilna team reads it; nothing is published without your permission."
msgstr "Kontatu zer joan den gaizki, zerk harritu zaituen edo zer nahiko zenukeen. Vilnaren taldeak bakarrik irakurtzen du; ez da ezer argitaratzen zure baimenik gabe."

msgid "What is it about?"
msgstr "Zeri buruzkoa da?"

msgid "Something does not work"
msgstr "Zerbaitek ez du funtzionatzen"

msgid "An idea or a wish"
msgstr "Ideia edo nahi bat"

msgid "Something else"
msgstr "Beste zerbait"

msgid "Your message"
msgstr "Zure mezua"

msgid "Add facts about this computer"
msgstr "Gehitu ordenagailu honi buruzko datuak"

msgid "You may answer me by e-mail"
msgstr "Posta elektronikoz erantzun didazue"

msgid "E-mail address"
msgstr "Helbide elektronikoa"

msgid "You may publish it, without my address, after reading it"
msgstr "Argitara dezakezue, nire helbiderik gabe, irakurri ondoren"

msgid "Add my conversation with Gloxi from the installation"
msgstr "Gehitu instalazioan Gloxirekin izandako nire elkarrizketa"

msgid "It may have your name, the computer's name or a Wi-Fi network. You read it before it is added."
msgstr "Zure izena, ordenagailuarena edo Wi-Fi sare bat izan ditzake. Gehitu aurretik irakurriko duzu."

msgid "Conversation with Gloxi"
msgstr "Elkarrizketa Gloxirekin"

msgid "Read"
msgstr "Irakurri"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "Gehitu"

msgid "Do not add"
msgstr "Ez gehitu"

msgid "What will be sent"
msgstr "Zer bidaliko den"

msgid "Send"
msgstr "Bidali"

msgid "Sending…"
msgstr "Bidaltzen…"

msgid "Thank you! Your feedback is sent."
msgstr "Eskerrik asko! Zure iritzia bidali da."

msgid "Write what happened or what you suggest."
msgstr "Idatzi zer gertatu den edo zer proposatzen duzun."

msgid "This does not look like an e-mail address."
msgstr "Hau ez dirudi helbide elektroniko bat."

msgid "The message is longer than 8000 characters."
msgstr "Mezuak 8000 karaktere baino gehiago ditu."

msgid "The report service is not running on this computer, so nothing can be sent now. Your text stays here."
msgstr "Txosten-zerbitzua ez dabil ordenagailu honetan, beraz ezin da ezer bidali orain. Zure testua hemen geratzen da."

msgid "Not sent: {reason}"
msgstr "Ez da bidali: {reason}"

msgid "Crash reports stay on this computer until they are sent. Each one has only what you see here: which program crashed and where in its code."
msgstr "Hutsegite-txostenak ordenagailu honetan geratzen dira bidali arte. Bakoitzak hemen ikusten duzuna soilik du: zein programak huts egin duen eta bere kodearen zein zatitan."

msgid "No crash reports."
msgstr "Ez dago hutsegite-txostenik."

msgid "If a program crashes, send us a crash report?"
msgstr "Programa batek huts egiten badu, hutsegitearen txostena bidaliko diguzu?"

msgid "Send automatically"
msgstr "Bidali automatikoki"

msgid "Ask me every time"
msgstr "Galdetu niri aldi bakoitzean"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "Inoiz ez"

msgid "No answer yet: nothing is sent."
msgstr "Oraindik erantzunik ez: ez da ezer bidaltzen."

msgid "The answer was not changed."
msgstr "Erantzuna ez da aldatu."

msgid "Not sent"
msgstr "Bidali gabe"

msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Bidalita"

msgid "Not accepted by the server"
msgstr "Zerbitzariak ez du onartu"

msgid "First report of this crash"
msgstr "Hutsegite honen lehen txostena"

msgid "We already know about this crash"
msgstr "Badakigu hutsegite honen berri"

msgid "Fixed in {version}"
msgstr "{version} bertsioan konponduta"

msgid "View"
msgstr "Ikusi"

msgid "Crash report"
msgstr "Hutsegite-txostena"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Itxi"

msgid "Do not send"
msgstr "Ez bidali"

msgid "Delete everything I sent from the server"
msgstr "Ezabatu zerbitzaritik bidali dudan guztia"

msgid "Deleted from the server: {count}"
msgstr "Zerbitzaritik ezabatuak: {count}"

msgid "{program} crashed"
msgstr "{program} programak huts egin du"

msgid "Send us a crash report? It has only which program crashed and where in its code."
msgstr "Hutsegitearen txostena bidaliko diguzu? Zein programak huts egin duen eta bere kodearen zein zatitan, besterik ez du."